get to epic boss battles like you've never experienced before.\n\nFeatures\n- \ud83d\udd25Thrill of the hack-and-slash\n- \ud83e\udd81Variety of enemies and bosses\n- \u2694\ufe0fPlenty of weapons and perks\n- \u26f0\ufe0fSeamless huge dungeons\n- \u2620\ufe0fBoss melee fight in VR\n- \ud83d\ude80Sandbox & Parkour & UGC", "short_description": "Battle Talent is a challenging physics-based roguelite sword-fighting game.\n\nTired of fighting boring enemies? Battle Talent has created for you a mega seamless procedural dungeon. The full version with over 80 enemy variants, 100 weapons, 60 perks, and multiple landscapes that change each time."}]}, "developer_name": "CyDream", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cydream.tech/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CyDream", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://cydream.tech/battletalent.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "FIGHTING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["nn", "es_VE", "de", "es_AR", "ru", "sv", "es_PE", "ru_UA", "en", "fr", "es", "ar", "fr_CA", "es_PR", "zh_TW", "nb", "zh_HK", "fr_BE", "es_CL", "id", "pl", "es_MX", "zh_CN", "es_CO", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3550795258488750"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974730_904968280074735_7167265498396280390_n.png?stp=dst